WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.900
Fictional native tour: independence notice, privacy, terms acceptance and the Spanish language selection.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.900
Saved login with simulated biometric approval; the basic demo needs no bank credentials.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.900
Security question, token, device approval and required password change: simulated checks.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.900
Offline demo: fictional accounts, DOP/USD, balance privacy and swipe-direction arrows.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.900
Simulated banking history: search and filters; the demo shares a fictional CSV through Android.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.900
Synthetic PDF: pages, zoom, sharing and selected-period saving with a simulated folder.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.900
Demo: own-account, same-bank and other-bank transfers; simulated advanced bank-recipient selection.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.900
A demo service payment and review with simulated SMS verification.

9
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:11.900
Recipient details from a code, simulated bank deletion and a fictional beneficiary saved in the demo.

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.900
Card controls, loss, theft and travel in simulated banking scenarios.

11
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:27.900
Simulated Token BSC: contract, consent, approval, code and unlinking.

12
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.900
Fictional QR request: saving, recipient review and print preview.

13
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:43.733
Settings and reconciliation; bank authorization and owner-account validation remain unresolved.
